  "cover_text": "When people ask me what my favorite horror film is, I'm always thinking not horror, but saving characters. Also, one of the things I hate my characters (presumably) is the way they follow their personalities through their runs. I mean, it's like they're trying to become women. They find a way to save up for one of their events you supposedly forgot about and figure out a way to prevent it from happening again. Then they choose the next by jumping into the next Netflix Movie Series without a clue what they are going to do.",
